From 1d31e979147db62d875b5990ffefd6f1c11f9431 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PromethenDev <PromethenDev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 08:06:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Always-on freeze report (GitHub #21/#25)

A 1 Hz watchdog plus a lock-free ring of kernel sync events. When the game
stops presenting for 10 s it writes logs/wwe13-freeze-<time>.txt (threads,
wait objects and ages, host backtraces, recent sync events, log tail). When
the player closes the window it writes logs/wwe13-exit-<time>.txt with the
same contents (newest 3 kept), which catches freezes where the picture stops
but frames keep being presented. No per-frame cost. WWE13_FREEZE_LOG=0
disables it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
